        "sid": "2KI 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah's Illness",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days Hezekiah became ill and was at the point of death. The prophet Isaiah son of Amoz went to him and said, \"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: Put your house in order, because you are going to die; you will not recover.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah turned his face to the wall and prayed to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Remember,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", how I have walked before you faithfully and with wholehearted devotion and have done what is good in your eyes.\" And Hezekiah wept bitterly.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Before Isaiah had left the middle court, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to him:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Go back and tell Hezekiah, the ruler of my people, 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of your father David, says: I have heard your prayer and seen your tears; I will heal you. On the third day from now you will go up to the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will add fifteen years to your life. And I will deliver you and this city from the hand of the king of Assyria. I will defend this city for my sake and for the sake of my servant David.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaiah said, \"Prepare a poultice of figs.\" They did so and applied it to the boil, and he recovered.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah had asked Isaiah, \"What will be the sign that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will heal me and that I will go up to the temple of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on the third day from now?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaiah answered, \"This is the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s sign to you that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will do what he has promised: Shall the shadow go forward ten steps, or shall it go back ten steps?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It is a simple matter for the shadow to go forward ten steps,\" said Hezekiah. \"Rather, have it go back ten steps.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the prophet Isaiah called on the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made the shadow go back the ten steps it had gone down on the stairway of Ahaz.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Envoys From Babylon",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time Marduk-Baladan son of Baladan king of Babylon sent Hezekiah letters and a gift, because he had heard of Hezekiah's illness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezekiah received the envoys and showed them all that was in his storehouses—the silver, the gold, the spices and the fine olive oil—his armory and everything found among his treasures. There was nothing in his palace or in all his kingdom that Hezekiah did not show them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaiah the prophet went to King Hezekiah and asked, \"What did those men say, and where did they come from?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 20:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"From a distant land,\" Hezekiah replied. \"They came from Babylon.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The prophet asked, \"What did they see in your palace?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2KI 20:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"They saw everything in my palace,\" Hezekiah said. \"There is nothing among my treasures that I did not show them.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Isaiah said to Hezekiah, \"Hear the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ":",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The time will surely come when everything in your palace, and all that your predecessors have stored up until this day, will be carried off to Babylon. Nothing will be left, says the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.20.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And some of your descendants, your own flesh and blood who will be born to you, will be taken away, and they will become eunuchs in the palace of the king of Babylon.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.20.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
